1
00:00:11,011 --> 00:00:11,011
[Verse 1]

2
00:00:11,011 --> 00:00:15,957
Dad came home when the day was done

3
00:00:15,957 --> 00:00:19,548
Quiet hands, still getting things done

4
00:00:19,548 --> 00:00:23,936
