9
00:00:36,144 --> 00:00:43,245
Still, there was more I wanted us to be

10
00:00:43,245 --> 00:00:43,245
[Verse 2]

11
00:00:43,245 --> 00:00:47,394
Now he’s retired, with room to unwind

12
00:00:47,394 --> 00:00:52,181
And I know good wine is what he's trying to find

13
00:00:52,181 --> 00:00:57,207
My friend said, “Try Casedrops, take a look—

14
00:00:57,207 --> 00:01:01,436
World-class bottles, trade-price for you”

15
00:01:01,436 --> 00:01:05,745
Up to eighty percent off, delivered free

16
00:01:05,745 --> 00:01:11,090
Refunds if it’s not your cup of - well, wine for me

17
00:01:11,090 --> 00:01:14,761
So I brought a case and showed him the app

18
00:01:14,761 --> 00:01:15,957
We picked out a bottle and settled right back

19
00:01:15,957 --> 00:01:20,585
We picked out a bottle and settled right back

20
00:01:20,585 --> 00:01:20,585
[Bridge]

21
00:01:20,585 --> 00:01:25,293
