22
00:01:25,293 --> 00:01:30,399
Then laughter came easy, like it used to do

23
00:01:30,399 --> 00:01:35,106
One good evening turned into more

24
00:01:35,106 --> 00:01:41,170
Three years on, we’re closer than before

25
00:01:41,170 --> 00:01:41,170
[Chorus]

26
00:01:41,170 --> 00:01:44,362
Casedrops, good wine brought home

27
00:01:44,362 --> 00:01:50,505
Find your next favourite, make it your own

28
00:01:50,505 --> 00:01:54,415
Casedrops, raise a glass together

29
00:01:54,415 --> 00:01:58,963
Dad and me, better than ever

30
00:01:58,963 --> 00:02:03,830
